---
import { APP_LOGIN_URL, BRAND, DEMO } from '../config';
---

<section class="notes" id="notes" aria-label="Notes">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="notes-inner">
    <ol>
      <li>{DEMO.hotelName} is a sample property. Every figure, chart and rate on this page is illustrative, computed the same way HotelierOS computes them from a real PMS export.</li>
      <li>The pricing shown is a teaser demand curve. The live model controls for season, day of week, lead time and logged competitor rates.</li>
    </ol>
  </div></div>
</section>
<footer>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="foot-inner">
    <div class="wordmark">{BRAND.pre}<span>{BRAND.accent}</span></div>
    <div class="foot-links">
      <a href={APP_LOGIN_URL}>Log in</a>
      <a href="#request">Request access</a>
      <span class="foot-link-disabled" aria-disabled="true" title="Coming soon">Contact</span>
      <span class="foot-link-disabled" aria-disabled="true" title="Coming soon">Privacy</span>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-copy">© 2026 HotelierOS</div>
  </div></div>
</footer>
